@startuml UC7_VisualizationPath_Final
autonumber "<b>0:"
title [UC7] Visualization of a Searched Path

actor "User" as User
participant "Mobile Application" as Client

participant "MapServiceProvider" as Map

note over User, Client: Entry Condition: User has selected a path and presses "View"

User -> Client: pressView(bikePathID)
activate Client

Client -> Client: fetchAggregatedPathData\n(bikePathID)


' Recupero Mappa dal Service Provider
loop For each Street in BikePath

    Client -> Map: requestMapContext\n(Street.coordinates)
    activate Map
    Map --> Client: MapTiles/VectorData
    deactivate Map
end

note right of Client: **Rendering Logic:**\nOverlay Business Data (Colored Lines) on Map Tiles


Client -> Client: renderMapWithOverlays()
Client --> User: BikePath, Map

User -> Client: pressExit()

Client -> Client: closeDetailView()
Client --> User: returnToRankedList()

note over User, Client: Exit Condition: User returns to the search results

deactivate Client
@enduml